    {
      "name": "ChatCopyButton",
      "note": "Chat control. The quiet copy affordance on assistant messages and code blocks (ChatCopyButton). A 32x32 subtle button (token `8` square target) with 4px (`1`) padding and `sm` radius, sharing the composer toolbar's subtle state set: transparent rest (SubtleFillColorTransparent), hover SubtleFillColorSecondary (`subtleHover`), pressed SubtleFillColorTertiary (`subtlePressed`). Idle glyph is Segoe Fluent Copy (U+E8C8) in `ChatSecondaryTextBrush` (`muted`). On copy it flips to the CheckMark (U+E73E) in `ChatCopySuccessBrush` (`positive`), announces \"Copied\" through a polite live region, and resets after 2 seconds; a failure shows SystemFillColorCritical (`critical`). Previewed in the idle state.",
      "root": {
        "id": "chat-copy-root",
        "el": "button",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "title": "Copy",
          "aria-label": "Copy"
        },
        "layout": {
          "mode": "horizontal",
          "align": "center",
          "justify": "center",
          "padding": "1",
          "width": 32,
          "height": 32
        },
        "appearance": {
          "color": "muted",
          "background": "$none",
          "radius": "sm"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
          "focus": { "kind": "outline", "color": "accent" }
        },
        "states": {
          "hover": { "background": "subtleHover" },
          "pressed": { "background": "subtlePressed" },
          "hoverPressed": { "background": "subtlePressed" }
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "chat-copy-glyph",
            "el": "span",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true",
              "style": "font-family:'Segoe Fluent Icons','Segoe MDL2 Assets',sans-serif;font-size:16px"
            },
            "children": [ "\uE8C8" ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "AgentIdentityBadge",
      "note": "Agent identity row from Controls/AgentIdentityBadge.xaml (#1541): a 32x32 PersonPicture avatar (circular, so `pill` radius) to the LEFT of a two-line stack — agent display name in body type over the agent id in caption `muted` (TextFillColorSecondary) — with a trailing `muted` ChevronDown (Segoe Fluent U+E70D, previewed ~12px) marking it as the assistant selector's dropdown trigger. It ships as a subtle transparent WinUI DropDownButton (SubtleFillColorTransparent rest via `control.chrome:none`, `subtleHover`/`subtlePressed` through `states`, and a `control.focus` accent focus rectangle), so it stays quiet chrome and spends no accent at rest. Column spacing 12px maps to token 3; MinHeight 40 and the PersonPicture initials/photo fallback are port notes. Used as the assistant selector trigger and anywhere an agent is named. In-app the avatar is a real PersonPicture (initials or gateway avatar), previewed here with a person glyph.",
      "props": {
        "name": "Aurora",
        "handle": "agent-aurora"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "agent-badge-root",
        "el": "button",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "aria-haspopup": "listbox",
          "aria-label": "{name}"
        },
        "layout": {
          "mode": "horizontal",
          "gap": "3",
          "align": "center",
          "padding": "1",
          "width": "fill"
        },
        "appearance": {
          "background": "$none",
          "radius": "sm"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
