    {
      "name": "NotificationFlyout",
      "note": "App notifications flyout from Controls/NotificationFlyoutContent.xaml (#1541), opened from the Workspace footer bell. A 352px column: a right-aligned Clear all link, a scrolling list of notification cards, and a footer pairing an Open notifications link with a tertiary active-count caption. Each card is a `surface` (CardBackgroundFillColorDefault) panel with a 1px `line` border, `md` (8px) radius and 12px (token 3) padding, laying out a leading severity glyph, a stack of body-strong title + caption message + caption `muted` metadata, and a trailing dismiss button. A recurrence count rides a `warning` Badge beside the title. An empty state swaps the list for a single centered card. Severity glyphs are Segoe Fluent Icons in-app; previewed here with a stroked alert glyph.",
      "props": {
        "title": "Approval required",
        "message": "A Windows node capability is waiting for your approval.",
        "metadata": "Just now · Node",
        "count": "2×"
